|desc=
Attack the target for {{ctwd|160|250%}} nature weapon damage.

If the attack brings your target's life low enough (see below) or kills it, you can try to swallow it, killing it automatically and regaining (2 * Target Level + 5) life while reducing your equilibrium by (Target Level + 5).

The chance to swallow depends on your talent level and the relative size of the target.

The maximum percentage of life the target may have to still be swallowed is {{cl|(Talent Level * (Self [[Size]] / Target Size))|50%|13|1|25%|5}}.

The swallow attempt checks your physical power against the target's physical save.

Even targets that are immune to instant kills can be swallowed if they have 5% or less health.

Each point in sand drake talents also increases your physical resistance by 0.5%.

Levels in Swallow additionally raises your Physical and Mental critical rate by {{cts|2|10%|0.5}}, passively
